msgid "ZeroScale Cursor"
msgstr "零缩放光标"

msgid "Zero-scale selected elements to the cursor (along the cursor's Z-axis)"
msgstr "将选中的元素缩放至光标（沿光标的 Z 轴）"

msgid ""
"Zero-scale selected elements to nearest Vertical or Horizontal of global axis,\n"
"based on mouse pos relative to active element (V or H)."
msgstr "将选中的元素按全局轴（垂直或水平）四舍五入，基于鼠标相对于活动元素的相对位置（V 或 H）。"

